{
  "id": "linux_android_smarthome_609",
  "instruction": "The Owner has changed the Guest arrival time. Verify the update against the saved contact and `/tmp/home_ops/plan-revisions/source/priority.pdf`, then replace the old Calendar event on the first phone with the authorized time. Retire the old preparation workflow and schedule its replacement for the newly derived preparation time. In the reply to the Owner, identify the old and new arrival times and the corresponding old and new preparation times.",
